WEBVTT

00:22.856 --> 00:27.736
I've heard that a pack of wolves disperse
as soon as you strike their leader.

00:42.167 --> 00:46.171
Crap! I feel lightheaded.

00:55.221 --> 00:56.473
So hot!

00:56.556 --> 00:57.515
Yow! Yikes!

00:57.599 --> 00:58.725
What did he do?

00:58.808 --> 01:00.560
Maybe he touched a weird spot?

01:00.643 --> 01:02.687
Hey! The girl's getting away!

01:02.771 --> 01:04.439
Get her!

01:07.776 --> 01:08.860
Look out!

01:08.943 --> 01:11.362
The fence is falling down!
Let's get outta here quick!

01:11.446 --> 01:13.698
We're gonna be crushed!

01:13.782 --> 01:16.785
Dunno what's going on,
but now's my chance!

01:41.351 --> 01:42.227
Whoa.

01:43.812 --> 01:45.897
What a great view.

01:47.816 --> 01:50.860
Good thing this happened
to be a run-down hot springs.

01:50.944 --> 01:53.655
Talk about lucky.

01:53.738 --> 01:55.115
Yep, I sure am.

01:55.198 --> 01:57.283
Turbo Granny? What are you doing here?

01:57.367 --> 01:59.285
Don't underestimate me.

01:59.369 --> 02:03.790
It clicked when Seiko
mentioned the boy's address.

02:03.873 --> 02:07.168
That it was hot springs territory.

02:07.252 --> 02:12.340
That's why I stealthily
snuck into your backpack.

02:12.423 --> 02:14.342
Why can't you just ask to come?

02:14.425 --> 02:16.928
More like, what am I gonna do
about this building?

02:17.011 --> 02:22.225
Forget it, it was already run-down.
It's not like I did anything.

02:22.308 --> 02:24.853
Damn it! What the heck?

02:24.936 --> 02:26.187
Ow.

02:26.271 --> 02:28.356
Who the hell did all this?

02:29.399 --> 02:31.526
Are you the ones responsible?

02:31.609 --> 02:33.695
Hey! These guys are from the Kito family!

02:33.778 --> 02:35.530
You guys are still up to no good?

02:35.613 --> 02:37.991
Crap! Those are Chamber of Commerce guys!

02:39.450 --> 02:41.202
Stop!

02:43.288 --> 02:46.666
Scumbags! I hope you're locked up forever!

02:46.749 --> 02:49.627
Whew, that was a good bath.

02:50.753 --> 02:52.797
You saved me. Thanks.

02:52.881 --> 02:55.341
Who would ever save you?

02:55.425 --> 02:59.429
The powers within this vessel
just came out on their own.

02:59.512 --> 03:01.139
I guess so.

03:01.222 --> 03:03.725
Anyway, did you see Jiji's house?

03:04.309 --> 03:06.394
What do you think, Turbo Granny?

03:06.477 --> 03:08.938
I couldn't see anything at all.

03:09.022 --> 03:11.441
That place is no good.

03:11.524 --> 03:16.237
That house has soaked up
too much human blood.

03:23.661 --> 03:25.872
Wicked! What is this?

03:25.955 --> 03:27.624
What should we do, Okarun?

03:27.707 --> 03:29.083
I'm not sure, either.

03:29.167 --> 03:31.920
For now, let's wait
until Miss Ayase comes back.

03:32.003 --> 03:34.505
It's dangerous
to haphazardly jump in there.

03:37.717 --> 03:39.344
Miss Ayase is back.

03:39.427 --> 03:40.845
Nice timing!

03:40.929 --> 03:43.264
Momo! I found something...

05:25.533 --> 05:28.244
You know that stupid family on the corner?

05:28.328 --> 05:31.622
They never say hello!

05:31.706 --> 05:33.958
Really. That makes me sick.

05:34.042 --> 05:37.170
This is our territory after all.

05:37.253 --> 05:41.674
People who don't know about manners
need to be taught a lesson.

05:41.758 --> 05:46.763
Jin, don't just stand there.
Sit down and have some snacks.

05:46.846 --> 05:48.056
Thanks!

05:48.139 --> 05:51.434
That's right, you better stay friendly.

05:51.517 --> 05:55.104
You don't have to pay rent
because I'm so thoughtful.

05:55.188 --> 05:56.856
Thanks!

05:56.939 --> 05:59.817
Kids have such a hard time
when their parents are so weak.

05:59.901 --> 06:04.614
If it weren't for us, you'd be out
on the street with nowhere to go.

06:04.697 --> 06:07.200
That's right. You should be grateful.

06:07.283 --> 06:10.119
Mr. Jiji, what's the meaning of this?

06:10.203 --> 06:12.205
This is a rental house.

06:12.288 --> 06:15.792
While my parents are hospitalized,
I don't have to pay rent.

06:16.375 --> 06:19.712
These folks are the Kitos, the landlords.

06:19.796 --> 06:23.382
Thanks to them, I can stay in this house.

06:23.466 --> 06:26.844
Then, we really did
a bad thing to that wall.

06:26.928 --> 06:29.305
If they ask, say you don't know.

06:29.388 --> 06:31.307
Hey, Jin.

06:31.390 --> 06:36.437
You disappeared without telling us.

06:36.521 --> 06:41.192
My friend said he wanted to come visit,
so I went to go pick him up!

06:41.275 --> 06:42.985
I can at least do that, right?

06:43.069 --> 06:45.488
Not that I think you would,

06:45.571 --> 06:51.494
but you didn't try to bring in another
spirit medium or something, did you?

06:52.286 --> 06:54.539
Huh? Gimme a break already!

06:55.123 --> 06:57.250
We don't have any ghosts
around here, you dimwit!

06:57.834 --> 07:00.211
Are you trying to ruin
our property's good reputation?

07:00.795 --> 07:03.464
Don't go around lying
to people about ghosts!

07:03.548 --> 07:04.423
Oh, no.

07:04.507 --> 07:07.093
Does he look like a spirit medium to you?

07:07.176 --> 07:10.263
I was simply fooled by those other people!

07:11.180 --> 07:14.475
I have a hunter's license, you know?

07:14.559 --> 07:18.479
Unfortunate accidents happen
pretty often in the mountains.

07:18.563 --> 07:22.650
For instance, if I was hunting a boar,

07:22.733 --> 07:26.821
and a person just happened
to jump in front of me.

07:26.904 --> 07:29.699
Oh, come on, now.

07:29.782 --> 07:31.492
Even if you have a license,

07:31.576 --> 07:35.413
pointing a gun at people
will get you in trouble with the police.

07:35.496 --> 07:37.415
Hello there!

07:45.381 --> 07:47.884
Man, that was a pain.

07:47.967 --> 07:50.928
The Chamber of Commerce guys found us.

07:51.012 --> 07:55.016
If Officer Tsuru didn't help us out,
we'd have been in trouble.

07:55.099 --> 07:57.393
That place was way too run-down.

07:57.477 --> 07:59.562
We have to find our next spot.

07:59.645 --> 08:02.190
It's troublesome for me
if you're too reckless.

08:02.273 --> 08:04.233
It's hard dealing with the aftermath.

08:04.317 --> 08:07.278
What did you guys do this time?

08:07.361 --> 08:08.946
That's a secret from you, Mom.

08:09.030 --> 08:13.117
If anyone in the Kito family
gets arrested, it's your fault, Tsuru.

08:13.201 --> 08:16.329
Yo, Jin! Where have you been?

08:16.412 --> 08:18.498
Well, I was out with my friend.

08:18.581 --> 08:21.125
Don't you dare lie, okay?

08:21.209 --> 08:25.004
I hate liars more than anything else.

08:25.087 --> 08:26.339
Sure.

08:26.422 --> 08:27.632
Who's this guy?

08:28.341 --> 08:32.053
Oh, he's my best friend,
and he wanted to come visit.

08:35.723 --> 08:38.559
So what's Jin's favorite soccer team?

08:39.602 --> 08:41.687
You'd know if you were
his best friend, right?

08:41.771 --> 08:42.772
Um, he's...

08:42.855 --> 08:44.232
Jin, you stay quiet.

08:45.024 --> 08:49.278
It's not like you guys just met, is it?

08:49.362 --> 08:52.615
If you weren't actually his best friend,

08:52.698 --> 08:58.829
I'd have to ask why
Jin brought you to this house.

09:02.542 --> 09:03.543
Z...

09:04.210 --> 09:05.711
Zaint-Germain.

09:13.344 --> 09:15.429
Well, well!

09:15.513 --> 09:17.515
You do know.

09:17.598 --> 09:20.309
He's Jin's best friend.

09:25.481 --> 09:27.775
Okarun! Nice one!

09:27.858 --> 09:30.069
Hey, Jin!

09:30.820 --> 09:34.156
There was one more. A girl.

09:34.240 --> 09:36.367
When's she coming back?

09:37.451 --> 09:41.372
Let's see, a girl. I wonder who that is?

09:41.455 --> 09:44.959
Come on, Jin. Are you telling the truth?

09:45.042 --> 09:47.044
Huh? Well, yes.

09:47.128 --> 09:50.214
You did yourself in just now.

09:50.298 --> 09:53.175
You lied to us.

09:57.346 --> 10:02.268
This must be the shrine
for the tsuchinoko, right?

10:03.853 --> 10:06.564
But more like, what's up with that guy?

10:07.273 --> 10:09.191
Do you need anything?

10:09.275 --> 10:10.526
Oh, um...

10:11.027 --> 10:13.571
Is this the tsuchinoko shrine?

10:13.654 --> 10:15.781
Oh, yes.

10:16.365 --> 10:18.242
Apologies for the awkward sight.

10:18.326 --> 10:20.328
I'm trying to become a BooTuber.

10:20.411 --> 10:22.538
Please, come on in.

10:23.122 --> 10:27.376
Are you sure it's okay to show me?
Isn't that valuable?

10:27.460 --> 10:28.544
Not at all.

10:28.628 --> 10:31.172
I can't make any money
off of something like this.

10:31.255 --> 10:33.257
Man, I wanna be a BooTuber.

10:33.341 --> 10:35.968
Wow, I can't wait!

10:36.052 --> 10:38.471
I should come back here again with Okarun!

10:42.725 --> 10:44.352
A tsuchinoko?

10:44.935 --> 10:45.853
Doesn't look like it.

10:45.936 --> 10:47.521
I agree with you.

10:47.605 --> 10:48.397
GREAT SERPENT LORD

10:48.481 --> 10:50.858
According to documents
remaining in this shrine,

10:50.941 --> 10:53.694
"Dragon rising to heaven
will cast a rainbow,

10:53.778 --> 10:57.239
and the wrath of the mountain
will engulf the village."

10:57.865 --> 11:00.785
This region worshipped a giant snake.

11:00.868 --> 11:02.244
It was believed that

11:02.328 --> 11:06.707
when the giant snake living in the volcano
gets hungry, the volcano erupts.

11:06.791 --> 11:11.754
Back then, the people offered
one child from the village as a sacrifice

11:11.837 --> 11:14.423
to satiate the giant snake's hunger.

11:14.965 --> 11:19.261
By doing so for the past 200 years,
it has kept the volcano from erupting,

11:19.345 --> 11:23.057
and was even granted
the blessing of hot springs.

11:24.892 --> 11:26.310
The thing that looks like

11:26.394 --> 11:29.814
an umbilical cord is supposedly
from when the giant snake molted.

11:29.897 --> 11:32.274
Nowadays, by enshrining
that giant snake skin,

11:32.358 --> 11:35.069
it's preventing the volcano from erupting.

11:35.152 --> 11:36.737
Then, what about the tsuchinoko?

11:36.821 --> 11:37.822
My father said

11:37.905 --> 11:40.741
there would be more tourists
if we called it a tsuchinoko.

11:40.825 --> 11:41.742
Son of a...

11:41.826 --> 11:46.330
But thanks to that,
people like you do come visit.

11:46.414 --> 11:49.542
This legend of the giant snake
is a human sin.

11:50.126 --> 11:53.421
People who are robbed
of logical thinking due to fear

11:53.504 --> 11:56.632
can believe in and even execute
human sacrifices.

11:56.715 --> 11:58.843
So we don't repeat such sins,

11:58.926 --> 12:02.221
I take the time
and tell visitors of this tale.

12:03.889 --> 12:07.226
Although I really want to become
a headstand BooTuber.

12:07.309 --> 12:09.603
Wait, why don't you tell
that story on BooTube?

12:12.982 --> 12:15.568
There was no tsuchinoko.

12:15.651 --> 12:18.654
Okarun is going to be really disappointed.

12:19.363 --> 12:23.617
But he might like that old,
local folktale story.

12:24.785 --> 12:26.036
Okay, then.

12:26.662 --> 12:29.999
I wonder if the two boys
are deepening their friendship.

12:31.083 --> 12:34.837
I'm home. Did the ghosts show up?

12:39.592 --> 12:42.511
Our offerings are finally all here.

12:42.595 --> 12:47.224
Now let's start our festival.

13:04.366 --> 13:05.784
Ouch.

13:05.868 --> 13:06.994
Boobies!

13:36.899 --> 13:39.818
Crap. I'm getting dizzy.

13:40.361 --> 13:41.987
There, there.

13:42.071 --> 13:45.157
Good girl. Don't be scared.

13:46.951 --> 13:49.578
God damn turd!

13:53.832 --> 13:55.209
Ow.

13:55.292 --> 13:58.379
Just when I was sleeping soundly...

13:58.462 --> 14:01.048
Who the hell was squishing me like that?

14:01.131 --> 14:03.259
Turbo Granny! Thanks!

14:03.342 --> 14:05.678
And it'd help a ton
if you could lend me a hand.

14:05.761 --> 14:07.721
I ain't gonna help ya.

14:08.764 --> 14:11.475
So, who are these guys?

14:11.559 --> 14:13.394
That's what I wanna know!

14:15.020 --> 14:17.147
Calm down, young lady.

14:17.231 --> 14:18.774
Stay away from me!

14:18.857 --> 14:20.484
Get outta this house right now!

14:20.568 --> 14:21.986
Hurry up!

14:43.424 --> 14:44.550
That hurt.

14:48.095 --> 14:49.471
Is she for real?

14:59.315 --> 15:00.774
Jennifer!

15:01.609 --> 15:02.860
Lopez!

15:02.943 --> 15:06.864
Anaconda!

15:14.538 --> 15:18.959
Mom is the strongest
old woman in the Kito family!

15:19.043 --> 15:21.045
Who exactly is that girl?

15:21.629 --> 15:26.175
It seemed like she was using
some sort of strange power.

15:27.301 --> 15:29.720
What exactly is that old hag?

15:29.803 --> 15:31.764
She's just a powerful old hag.

15:31.847 --> 15:33.307
Like they actually exist.

15:33.390 --> 15:35.392
You got one in your own house.

15:35.476 --> 15:36.435
True.

15:36.518 --> 15:38.020
Mom, look at that!

15:38.103 --> 15:40.981
Things are floating,
and there's a talking cat!

15:41.065 --> 15:44.443
More like, what's with this room?
It's seriously gross!

15:45.152 --> 15:47.613
Who the hell is this?

15:47.696 --> 15:50.491
She doesn't seem to be a spirit medium.

15:50.574 --> 15:54.203
If you're getting
in the way of the festival,

15:54.286 --> 15:57.957
then that means you're here
to destroy this village.

15:58.540 --> 16:03.045
The Kito family has protected
this land for generations.

16:03.128 --> 16:05.506
We won't let you have your way.

16:05.589 --> 16:06.632
Huh?

16:06.715 --> 16:08.884
You barged into someone's house,

16:08.968 --> 16:11.679
thrashed it all up,
and that's what you say?

16:11.762 --> 16:12.846
Get out of here!

16:12.930 --> 16:14.431
Come on now.

16:14.515 --> 16:17.768
Who do you think is responsible
for letting you bathe

16:17.851 --> 16:20.062
in the hot springs in peace?

16:20.145 --> 16:22.481
It's because we've been giving offerings

16:22.564 --> 16:26.193
to the Great Serpent Lord
for the past 200 years!

16:26.276 --> 16:29.363
Thanks to that, the volcano
is held back from erupting,

16:29.446 --> 16:30.990
and we're given the blessing of

16:31.073 --> 16:33.701
the Great Serpent Lord
through the hot springs.

16:33.784 --> 16:37.496
If we, the Kito family,
didn't manage this land,

16:37.579 --> 16:40.416
this village would be buried
in magma by now.

16:40.499 --> 16:43.293
Hold on a second! Did you say
you were offering sacrifices?

16:43.377 --> 16:45.838
Yeah. You deaf?

16:47.006 --> 16:50.676
This place is
where the original altar was.

16:50.759 --> 16:54.471
This is where human sacrifices were made.

16:54.555 --> 17:01.020
Its appearance changed with the times,
but this house is still that altar.

17:01.645 --> 17:08.027
And we of the Kito family
invite sacrifices into this house,

17:08.110 --> 17:12.531
and offer them to the Great Serpent Lord.

17:14.575 --> 17:15.826
No way.

17:15.909 --> 17:17.870
So that's why Jiji's parents...

17:17.953 --> 17:21.999
We lucked out.
We have exactly three people.

17:22.082 --> 17:25.711
We were almost short on offerings.

17:30.883 --> 17:35.429
The Great Serpent Lord
is quite hungry right now.

17:39.975 --> 17:42.811
What the hell is this?

17:43.353 --> 17:44.480
Crap!

17:44.563 --> 17:46.273
The floor turned into sand!

17:46.356 --> 17:48.192
Wanna go at it, huh?

17:48.275 --> 17:50.694
I have to get out of here!

17:54.698 --> 17:56.658
Think you can take me?!

18:06.543 --> 18:09.379
I won't let you cross this threshold.

18:09.463 --> 18:11.924
You'll be swallowed up by that quicksand

18:12.007 --> 18:15.177
and become
the Great Serpent Lord's offering!

18:15.260 --> 18:18.680
This is seriously bad!
Turbo Granny, do something!

18:24.394 --> 18:26.355
We've stepped into the quicksand!

18:26.438 --> 18:28.440
Into the Great Serpent Lord's realm!

18:28.524 --> 18:30.275
Miss Ayase, over here!

18:30.359 --> 18:31.485
Before it's too late!

18:31.568 --> 18:33.278
Momo! Use your psychic powers!

18:33.362 --> 18:36.073
Both of you, nice one! You're a lifesaver!

18:50.504 --> 18:51.755
Okarun, are you okay?

18:51.839 --> 18:53.423
Somehow...

18:57.636 --> 18:59.805
Wait, are you serious?

18:59.888 --> 19:02.432
How the hell are we gonna get back?

19:06.645 --> 19:08.730
What the hell are all these houses?

19:08.814 --> 19:11.066
Why are there so many underground?

19:11.775 --> 19:15.028
Momo! Okarun! Help me!

19:15.112 --> 19:17.364
Jiji! Where are you?

19:18.073 --> 19:19.241
Over here!

19:20.492 --> 19:21.368
Jiji!

19:24.246 --> 19:25.247
I'm gonna fall!

19:25.330 --> 19:26.790
I'll help you right now!

20:07.539 --> 20:08.916
Great Serpent Lord!

20:08.999 --> 20:11.752
How blessed we are by your arrival!

20:11.835 --> 20:18.175
We, the Kito family,
are your faithful emissaries!

20:18.258 --> 20:20.802
Get the pose right or it'll eat you!

20:20.886 --> 20:22.554
That's the Great Serpent Lord!

20:22.638 --> 20:23.722
I've never seen it before.

20:23.805 --> 20:27.226
On this occasion,
we present those three as sacrifices.

20:27.309 --> 20:30.395
Please do not mistake them
for members of the Kito Family!

20:30.479 --> 20:32.731
Great Serpent Lord?
You mean the one in this region's legend?

20:32.814 --> 20:34.816
Crap! It wasn't just a myth?

20:34.900 --> 20:37.444
That's a Kuragari.

20:37.527 --> 20:39.071
What the hell is a Kuragari?

20:39.154 --> 20:40.572
You know what that is?

20:41.240 --> 20:43.033
It's a Mongolian Death Worm!

20:48.080 --> 20:52.251
It's a giant man-eating earthworm UMA
said to live in the Gobi Desert!

20:52.334 --> 20:55.963
But the stories about it
say it's about 1.5 to two meters long.

20:56.046 --> 20:58.715
I've never heard
of a Death Worm this huge!

20:58.799 --> 21:01.009
Then for the past 200 years,

21:01.093 --> 21:04.596
those guys have been offering
sacrifices to an earthworm UMA?

21:04.680 --> 21:09.351
Now, Great Serpent Lord!
Please feast on those three there!

21:10.769 --> 21:13.313
Hey! Gimme a break, damn hag!

21:13.397 --> 21:16.858
That's not a god you're worshipping!

21:16.942 --> 21:19.820
That's just a man-eating earthworm!

21:19.903 --> 21:22.364
Be appeased...

21:22.447 --> 21:27.536
Be appeased...

21:32.541 --> 21:34.084
It ate them!

21:34.167 --> 21:35.919
What are we gonna do about this?

21:36.003 --> 21:37.963
There's no way we can
defeat something like this!

21:38.046 --> 21:40.549
This is definitely bad.

21:41.800 --> 21:43.802
Let's hide inside a house for now!

21:43.885 --> 21:45.887
Yeah, we can't stay outside.

21:52.769 --> 21:54.563
Both of you, hurry!

21:54.646 --> 21:56.315
That thing will spot you!

22:00.902 --> 22:03.030
What's wrong? Are both of you okay?

23:53.557 --> 23:54.891
Everyone, let's go!

23:54.975 --> 23:55.851
Yeah!

23:55.934 --> 23:57.644
The savage legend of the Great Serpent!

23:58.353 --> 24:01.481
Naki Kito! Work at hand never fails!

24:01.565 --> 24:04.025
That which is born from evil conventions...

24:04.109 --> 24:05.360
Its name is...

24:05.443 --> 24:07.946
Next episode, "The Evil Eye"!
